<title>JAPAN: Yaohan Japan rebounds in morning trade.</title>
<headline>Yaohan Japan rebounds in morning trade.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yaohan Japan Corp shares rebounded in Friday morning trade, after being depressed by the supermarket's request that its wholesalers and other suppliers accept a longer time-lag before they are paid, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0124 GMT, the shares were up 19 yen at 460 yen, the largest percentage gainer on the first section of the Tokyo bourse.</p>
